      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated and attentive veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients warmly praise Dr Lane Smith and the veterinary assistants for their attentive and patient approach. Reviewers note that veterinarians take unhurried time during consultations, sit directly on the floor with nervous pets, and listen carefully to owner concerns regarding complex animal health issues."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle interaction for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight how relaxed and comfortable their animals feel during clinic appointments. Both dogs and cats, including shy rescue pets, are handled with gentle encouragement and calm reassurance, making routine examinations and senior care far less stressful for families."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough diagnostics and effective treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers express strong confidence in clinical treatments, ranging from resolving stubborn skin infections to managing chronic feline health conditions. Clients appreciate that veterinary surgeons focus on discovering underlying causes rather than offering superficial symptom relief."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Dr Lane Smith accommodate nervous or anxious dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, multiple reviewers note that Dr Smith frequently sits on the floor to meet nervous pets at their own level, keeping visits calm and unhurried."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are diagnostic lab results communicated promptly?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients mention that veterinarians follow up by telephone on the same day with laboratory findings to initiate medication without delay."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic support elderly pets with palliative care?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners appreciate the sensitive and respectful support provided during end-of-life care and euthanasia procedures."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
